## Problem classes

### `Peer missing on Windows`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Other platforms see this machine; Windows does not appear | Windows browse-only. This process does not advertise. | Document the limit. Manual connect remains the way to reach a Windows host. Do not pretend Bonsoir advertise works there. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `Nearby badge says Same LAN but transfers fail`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Subnet match treated as reachable | `/hello` never ran, or AP isolation drops the TCP path | Badge Same LAN only after `/hello` succeeds. Otherwise Other LAN or BLE only, per `proximity.mdc`. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->
